      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3LongVideoRefPromptBuilder",
        "h3_import_text": "8 seconds total, realistic, warm lighting, first-person POV. I kneel at a low table in the tea room (Picture 2), looking slightly down; my face never appears and I don't speak.\nLin Wan (Picture 1) kneels across the table, centered in the frame.\n0–3 s: she lifts a celadon teapot and pours tea into a small cup; steam rises.\n3–5 s: she holds the cup in both hands, pushes it toward me and says softly (3–5 s): \"Careful, it's hot.\"\n5–8 s: my hands reach in from the bottom of the frame and take the cup, bringing it close to the lens; she smiles and rests her hands back on her knees."
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the first-person narrator, whose face is not visible, wearing soft white sleeves visible at the wrists.\n<Subject 2> is the young woman in <Picture 1>, with long dark hair in a bun secured by a silver hairpin, a red floral mark on her forehead, wearing a blue hanfu robe with a white inner layer, a maroon sash, and dangling earrings.\n<Subject 3> is the cozy room in <Picture 2>, featuring a large round window with a night view, wooden furniture, a low table, floor cushions, a fireplace, and warm lantern lighting.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] A first-person view of a quiet evening moment where a woman pours tea and hands a cup to the narrator in a warm, rustic room.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - hair bun, silver hairpin, red forehead mark, blue hanfu, white inner layer, maroon sash, dangling earrings.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - large round window with night view, wooden furniture, low table, floor cushions, fireplace, lantern lighting, potted plants.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe scene is set in a warm, rustic room with soft lighting, rendered in a realistic style. The camera maintains a stable first-person POV, looking slightly down across a low table.\n[Shot 1]\nFrom 0 to 3 seconds: The frame is centered on <Subject 2> kneeling at the table, facing the camera. She lifts a celadon teapot with her right hand and pours tea into a small cup on the table. Steam rises gently from the cup. Her expression is calm and focused. The background shows the round window and the warm glow of the room.\nFrom 3 to 5 seconds: <Subject 2> holds the tea cup in both hands. She pushes it gently toward the bottom of the frame. <Subject 2> (S1) says: <d>[English] Careful, it's hot.</d>\nFrom 5 to 8 seconds: <Subject 1>'s hands enter the frame from the bottom and take the cup, bringing it closer to the lens. <Subject 2> smiles softly and rests her hands back on her knees. The shot remains steady as the cup moves closer to the viewer.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA quiet, warm indoor atmosphere with soft ambient room tone. The dialogue is clear and intimate. No background music.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
        "[\"h3_prompt_builder/linwan_sheet.png [input]\",\"h3_prompt_builder/ref_07.png [input]\"]",
        0,
        true,
